UID:1A2JrLdOa5
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 103 mins (1h43m)\n\nSliding Scale Community Screenin
 gs An insurance salesman begins to suspect that his whole life is actually
  some sort of reality TV show. In appreciation of our movie-loving communi
 ty\, tickets to this screening are available on a sliding scale basis\, st
 arting at $5 for child tickets. Enjoy the film for less or give more gener
 ously to support nonprofit movie magic.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-a
 nd-events/sliding-scale-community-screenings/the-truman-show\n\nEstimated 
 start: 13:00
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
